glm: GLM_INDEX_CUT (off by default): glm_index_select stops at a complete radix bin

NOT LANDED: no local check exists for Metal or for the GLM family's host Zig (see ../SURVEY.md section 2).
Base: 2bb052f (applies to kernel-sweep-0290 as well). Apply with: git apply <this file>
Evidence: ../hmetal-glm/ (a CPU emulation of the old and new kernel text).
The one binder of GlmSelectArgs is forward.zig's setValue in selectKeys (state.zig's `sel` field names the struct
in a comment but nothing binds or reads it). tools/zig/lean_check.py: no finding added (checked on the patched files).

